  "details": "After I updated to 3.2.0 via the companion app I am unable to upload any avatar (even older ones that worked before) in my unity project. I get SerializedObjectNotCreatedException error and I have no idea why. After each 'run' attempt I get automatically logged out and need to log back in in order to attempt to upload again. I can provide the editor log file if requested. Uploading for quest with quest supported shaders only. Downgrading did not fix the problem, in fact it caused more. No other custom scrips running besides gesture manager. I get the same issue while uploading on PC as well.",
